  "content": "\n\n<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gNKaWWz.jpg\"></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"34\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 全面重做的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes o' Plenty</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 数千个全新地牢与建筑（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wabi-sabi-structures-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabi-Sabi Structures</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 建立你自己的王国（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">StyleColonies</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 探索魔法维度（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a> &amp; Addons, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 完全优化，支持光影</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 全面重做的要塞与堡垒</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 强大的Boss与神话生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">）</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 深度魔法模组（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon-repraised\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon: Repraised</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wizard's Reborn</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 耐力、口渴与温度系统（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/survive\" rel=\"nofollow\">Survive</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 指引你的简易任务</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 便捷功能，例如&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">可升级背包</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式的中世纪RPG体验</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 内置,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免费的世界分享</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f64101%252fmedieval-mc-forge-mmc4\" rel=\"nofollow\">350+ 款模组</a>, 经过深度定制以确保整合与兼容性</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://lunapixel.studio/discord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"235\" height=\"32\"></a></strong></h5>\n<p><strong><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rz_N4-2tevs\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dFd3YVpPFe0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></strong></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><strong>非官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准或认可。</strong></strong></span></h5>",
